{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 23,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When thou sittest to eat with a ruler,\nConsider diligently him that is before thee;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And put a knife to thy throat,\nIf thou be a man given to appetite.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not desirous of his dainties;\nSeeing they are deceitful food.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Weary not thyself to be rich;\nCease from thine own wisdom.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wilt thou set thine eyes upon that which is not?\nFor ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "riches",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " certainly make themselves wings,\nLike an eagle that flieth toward heaven.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Eat thou not the bread of him that hath an evil eye,\nNeither desire thou his dainties:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For as he thinketh within himself, so is he:\nEat and drink, saith he to thee;\nBut his heart is not with thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The morsel which thou hast eaten shalt thou vomit up,\nAnd lose thy sweet words.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Speak not in the hearing of a fool;\nFor he will despise the wisdom of thy words.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remove not the ancient landmark;\nAnd enter not into the fields of the fatherless:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For their Redeemer is strong;\nHe will plead their cause against thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Apply thy heart unto instruction,\nAnd thine ears to the words of knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Withhold not correction from the child;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "For",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " if thou beat him with the rod, he will not die.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt beat him with the rod,\nAnd shalt deliver his soul from Sheol.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, if thy heart be wise,\nMy heart will be glad, even mine:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, my heart will rejoice,\nWhen thy lips speak right things.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let not thy heart envy sinners;\nBut ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be thou",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the fear of Jehovah all the day long:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For surely there is a reward;\nAnd thy hope shall not be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear thou, my son, and be wise,\nAnd guide thy heart in the way.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not among winebibbers,\nAmong gluttonous eaters of flesh:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the drunkard and the glutton shall come to poverty;\nAnd drowsiness will clothe ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "a man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with rags.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hearken unto thy father that begat thee,\nAnd despise not thy mother when she is old.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Buy the truth, and sell it not;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", wisdom, and instruction, and understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The father of the righteous will greatly rejoice;\nAnd he that begetteth a wise child will have joy of him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let thy father and thy mother be glad,\nAnd let her that bare thee rejoice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, give me thy heart;\nAnd let thine eyes delight in my ways.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For a harlot is a deep ditch;\nAnd a foreign woman is a narrow pit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, she lieth in wait as a robber,\nAnd increaseth the treacherous among men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who hath woe? who hath sorrow? who hath contentions?\nWho hath complaining? who hath wounds without cause?\nWho hath redness of eyes?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that tarry long at the wine;\nThey that go to seek out mixed wine.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Look not thou upon the wine when it is red,\nWhen it sparkleth in the cup,\nWhen it goeth down smoothly:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "At the last it biteth like a serpent,\nAnd stingeth like an adder.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thine eyes shall behold strange things,\nAnd thy heart shall utter perverse things.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, thou shalt be as he that lieth down in the midst of the sea,\nOr as he that lieth upon the top of a mast.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.23.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.23.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They have stricken me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shalt thou say",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and I was not hurt;\nThey have beaten me, and I felt it not:\nWhen shall I awake? I will seek it yet again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
